    "encoding_note": "DisplayPort uses ANSI 8b/10b on the Main Link for RBR/HBR/HBR2/HBR3 (DC-balanced, transition-rich so the Sink recovers the embedded clock; 80% efficient; LFSR-scrambled) and 128b/132b for UHBR (~96.97%, FEC mandatory). The AUX channel uses Manchester-II bi-phase at ~1 Mbps. EDID is fetched by tunneling I2C-over-AUX (I2C address A0h)."
